 was invoked against a cited artifact, and the refund neither exceeds SGD 150.00 nor exceeds the charged total. The monetary effect, SGD 83.42, is above the SGD 8.00 automatic execution threshold in POL-GEN-05, so this ruling issues but is not executed automatically: the amount is held and the case goes to the human queue for release. This is a provisional ruling made without human review; either party may appeal it once within 30 days under POL-GEN-04."
